        "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >About the Myth: Wukong – Unfamiliar with or want to revisit the classic tale? Play &lt;Journey Card&gt; and experience the story of &lt;Journey to the West&gt; all over again!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In the original &lt;Journey to the West&gt;, the MonkTang rides the DragonHorse to the West, accompanied by his disciples: Wukong, Bajie, and SandMonk. Together, they face 81 trials and ultimately succeed in retrieving the sacred Buddhist scriptures.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >【Mini-game】</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A mini-game is built into the game with endless levels. You can carry over 1% of the score from the mini-game to the world map.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>The mini-game will be unlocked after defeating Tiger General and Bear General in Level 07.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3956550/extras/951dfa5172ef4ec5a7dd981845d77dc8.poster.avif?t=1763169535\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3956550/extras/951dfa5172ef4ec5a7dd981845d77dc8.webm?t=1763169535\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >【Journey Map】</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game features 81 levels, including tutorial stages, and offers around 30~80 hours of main storyline content. With 70+ beautifully designed scenes and 100+ character illustrations, it brings the rich world of Journey to the West to life.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3956550/extras/2441dbff35aa4d48ad7712657e982c32.avif?t=1763169535\" width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >【Stroy of <i>Journey to the West</i>】</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The script contains about 160,000 words, equivalent to an abridged picture-book version of <i>Journey to the West</i>,</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each level is carefully crafted to recreate the events and characters from the original novel. The famous figures are reimagined as powerful bosses in the game’s battles, offering players an immersive and exciting experience.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3956550/extras/b36eb611fc4544b2efc603d96aa0dff2.avif?t=1763169535\" width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >【Battle of Poker】</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game uses a Card-Based Battle system, where &quot;Cores&quot; serves as the player's HP. In addition to forming strategic card combinations to deal damage, players can also utilize special skills to outsmart their opponents and claim victory.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3956550/extras/97f4fa44c3038ab22cf1b0983a652e34.avif?t=1763169535\" width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >【Unique Skill】</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every card has its own unique skill, unlocked gradually as you progress through the stages, with usage charges earned through battles.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3956550/extras/470aa67a3b4aaf60da4ee0a314258bfd.avif?t=1763169535\" width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >【Custom Deck】</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In the later part of the journey, players unlock deck customization. Expanding and refining the deck improves the probability of forming preferred combinations, allowing more strategic victories.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3956550/extras/7702cab63af51a5b911819794fd6a8e7.avif?t=1763169535\" width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
        "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >About the Myth: Wukong – Unfamiliar with or want to revisit the classic tale? Play &lt;Journey Card&gt; and experience the story of &lt;Journey to the West&gt; all over again!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In the original &lt;Journey to the West&gt;, the MonkTang rides the DragonHorse to the West, accompanied by his disciples: Wukong, Bajie, and SandMonk. Together, they face 81 trials and ultimately succeed in retrieving the sacred Buddhist scriptures.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >【Mini-game】</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A mini-game is built into the game with endless levels. You can carry over 1% of the score from the mini-game to the world map.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>The mini-game will be unlocked after defeating Tiger General and Bear General in Level 07.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3956550/extras/951dfa5172ef4ec5a7dd981845d77dc8.poster.avif?t=1763169535\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3956550/extras/951dfa5172ef4ec5a7dd981845d77dc8.webm?t=1763169535\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >【Journey Map】</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game features 81 levels, including tutorial stages, and offers around 30~80 hours of main storyline content. With 70+ beautifully designed scenes and 100+ character illustrations, it brings the rich world of Journey to the West to life.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3956550/extras/2441dbff35aa4d48ad7712657e982c32.avif?t=1763169535\" width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >【Stroy of <i>Journey to the West</i>】</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The script contains about 160,000 words, equivalent to an abridged picture-book version of <i>Journey to the West</i>,</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each level is carefully crafted to recreate the events and characters from the original novel. The famous figures are reimagined as powerful bosses in the game’s battles, offering players an immersive and exciting experience.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3956550/extras/b36eb611fc4544b2efc603d96aa0dff2.avif?t=1763169535\" width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >【Battle of Poker】</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game uses a Card-Based Battle system, where &quot;Cores&quot; serves as the player's HP. In addition to forming strategic card combinations to deal damage, players can also utilize special skills to outsmart their opponents and claim victory.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3956550/extras/97f4fa44c3038ab22cf1b0983a652e34.avif?t=1763169535\" width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >【Unique Skill】</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every card has its own unique skill, unlocked gradually as you progress through the stages, with usage charges earned through battles.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3956550/extras/470aa67a3b4aaf60da4ee0a314258bfd.avif?t=1763169535\" width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >【Custom Deck】</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In the later part of the journey, players unlock deck customization. Expanding and refining the deck improves the probability of forming preferred combinations, allowing more strategic victories.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3956550/extras/7702cab63af51a5b911819794fd6a8e7.avif?t=1763169535\" width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
